# The server image needs Go source, go.mod/go.sum and schemas/v1. Nothing
# else belongs in the build context, and sending it is not free: seeds/
# alone reaches half a gigabyte once each seed has resolved its
# dependencies once, which made every deploy transfer 250MB. It also made
# deploys fail outright — a leftover deno cache under seeds/ contains a
# broken symlink, and the daemon refuses the whole context over it.
seeds/
.git/
dist/
backups/
test/e2e/tmp/
.csx/

*.exe
*.test
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

.vscode/
.idea/
.serena/
docs/
*.md
!go.mod
